text:
C1 is confirmed. `sendReceipt` turns a network failure into `Unreachable` (`src/mailer.ts:15`). The loop in `billInvoice` catches that error and starts over, and the restart includes the call to `charge` (`src/billing.ts:18`). `charge` sends a new POST each time and passes no idempotency key (`src/gateway.ts:7-11`), so every retry is a new charge. One invoice can be billed up to 3 times. If the third attempt also fails, the error is rethrown even though the money was taken (`src/billing.ts:22`). This charges customers more than once, so it blocks the merge. The fix is to charge once before the loop and retry only `sendReceipt`.

